  "description": "The Aspire Cyber G Slim Vape Kit combines elegant style and outstanding performance in a sleek, compact and portable design. Available in ten stunning colours, this device is the perfect companion for adult vapers looking for a stylish and convenient vaping solution that seamlessly fits into their lifestyle. The Cyber G Slim features an upgraded 1200mAh battery, providing ample power for any vaper who values extended vaping sessions, and can be easily and rapidly recharged via USB-C. Powered by the Aspire ASP Chipset, the device offers super-fast fire up times and Multiple Safety Protections including Low Wattage, Over Time, Short Circuit and Overcharge protections. Designed for versatility and easy on-the-go refills, the Cyber G Slim is compatible with the TG Pod, making it suitable for mouth-to-lung (0.8ohm pod) vaping styles. Equipped with a 2ml capacity and side-fill system, the Cyber G Slim makes refilling effortless and mess-free. The pods utilise advanced mesh coil technology, delivering consistent and rich flavour with every puff. The device also supports draw-activated operation, ensuring a hassle-free, intuitive vaping experience. Its upgraded battery capacity and easy side refill system further enhance its user-friendly features, which combined with the Cyber G Slim’s sleek and colourful aesthetics makes it a great choice for vapers seeking an affordable, no-nonsense, take-anywhere vape device. Discover premium liquid vape options designed to elevate your vaping experience with this kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
